# Keep generated workbooks and intermediate results out of Git.
# The owner approved publishing the two source files under data/ on 2026-08-15.
#
# The two `product_type_dictionary` outputs are TRACKED on purpose and are named
# below (#1304). They are the reviewed result of this reclassification, not a
# regenerable intermediate: `README.md` documents them as the deliverable and the
# item-description taxonomy work reads them. Ignored-but-tracked is a trap -- a
# cleanup that trusts the `*` above would delete a reviewed output -- so the
# exception is written down rather than left to memory.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*.py
!*.mjs
!data/
!data/README.md
!data/full_item_master.csv
!data/MerchGroup_Rework.xlsx
!product_type_dictionary.csv
!product_type_dictionary.summary.json
